nyumba ya Hazaeli","poem":1},{"text":"umene udzanyeketsa nyumba zaufumu za Beni-Hadadi.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Ndidzathyola chipata cha Damasiko;","poem":1},{"text":"ndidzawononga mfumu yokhala ku Chigwa cha Aveni,","poem":2},{"text":"ndiponso iye amene akugwira ndodo yaufumu mu Beti-Edeni.","poem":1},{"text":"Anthu a ku Aramu adzapita ku ukapolo ku Kiri,”","poem":2},{"text":"akutero Yehova.","poem":4}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["Yehova akuti,",{"text":"“Chifukwa anthu a ku Gaza akunka nachimwirachimwira,","poem":1},{"text":"Ine sindileka kuwalanga.","poem":2},{"text":"Popeza anatenga ukapolo mtundu wathunthu","poem":1},{"text":"ndi kuwugulitsa ku Edomu,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"ndidzatumiza moto pa makoma a Gaza","poem":1},{"text":"umene udzanyeketsa nyumba zake zaufumu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Ndidzawononga mfumu ya ku Asidodi","poem":1},{"text":"komanso amene akugwira ndodo yaufumu ku Asikeloni.","poem":2},{"text":"Ndidzalanga Ekroni,","poem":1},{"text":"mpaka wotsala mwa Afilisti atafa,”","poem":2},{"text":"akutero Ambuye Yehova.","poem":4}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["Yehova akuti,",{"text":"“Chifukwa anthu a ku Turo akunka nachimwirachimwira,","poem":1},{"text":"Ine sindileka kuwalanga.","poem":2},{"text":"Popeza iwo anagulitsa mtundu wathunthu ku ukapolo ku Edomu,","poem":1},{"text":"osasunga pangano laubale lija,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"Ine ndidzatumiza moto pa makoma a Turo","poem":1},{"text":"umene udzanyeketsa nyumba zake zaufumu.”","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["Yehova akuti,",{"text":"“Chifukwa anthu a ku Edomu akunka nachimwirachimwira,","poem":1},{"text":"Ine sindileka kuwalanga.","poem":2},{"text":"Popeza anathamangitsa mʼbale wake ndi lupanga,","poem":1},{"text":"popanda nʼchifundo chomwe.","poem":2},{"text":"Popeza mkwiyo wake unakulabe","poem":1},{"text":"ndipo ukali wake sunatonthozeke,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"Ine ndidzatumiza moto pa Temani","poem":1},{"text":"umene udzanyeketsa nyumba zaufumu za Bozira.”","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["Yehova akuti,",{"text":"“Chifukwa anthu a ku Amoni akunka nachimwirachimwira,","poem":1},{"text":"Ine sindileka kuwalanga.","poem":2},{"text":"Popeza anatumbula akazi oyembekezera a ku Giliyadi","poem":1},{"text":"nʼcholinga choti akuze malire awo,","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"Ine ndidzayatsa moto pa makoma a ku Raba","poem":1},{"text":"umene udzanyeketsa nyumba zake zaufumu.","poem":2},{"text":"Padzakhala kulira kwakukulu pa tsiku la nkhondoyo,","poem":1},{"text":"kumenyana kudzakhala kwafumbi ngati mkuntho wa kamvuluvulu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"Mfumu yawo idzatengedwa kupita ku ukapolo,","poem":1},{"text":"iyo pamodzi ndi akuluakulu ake,”","poem":2},{"text":"akutero Yehova.","poem":4}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/nya_bib/AMO/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/nya_bib/AMO/2.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/nya_bib/JOL/3.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}